ISO-10303-21;
/* Tsh263: SHELL_BASED_SURFACE_MODEL carrying two watertight CLOSED_SHELLs that share ONE ADVANCED_FACE entity ('shared_sliver_wall', the x=12 wall) plus its four EDGE_CURVEs and four VERTEX_POINTs: body A is a 12x9x6 block (volume 648), body B a 0.04x9x6 flake (volume 2.16, 0.333% of A, width factor 0.0396mm). The shared boundary face is the precondition a fold-into-the-neighbour sliver repair needs and that Tsh234/Tsh235's merely-touching slivers lack */
